      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "-Make reports system actually work instead of ignoring reported worlds with 10-20+ reports for crashers and malicious content\n-Hire more moderators and pick trustworthy community moderators, and give them the ability to remove bad/malicious worlds and avatars\n-Rework trust system, currently trusted users are more likely to be malicious than new users, add much more \"space\" between the ranks to reduce amount of trusted users (should take 1-2 years for trusted) and increase amount of new user/user/known users. Trusted should be very old accounts/players\n-Make automatic world approval from labs -> public, be more strict instead of letting the system publicize worlds while ignoring multiple reports on the worlds\n-Less temporary bans for crashers and malicious content, more permanent bans",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
