      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "While I agree that world moderation needs to be better, reporting a world for it being malicious, then seeing it public 10 minutes later, really feels pretty bad, I don't think this has anything to do with Udon at all. If you want to make a 0.1MB world that will instantly crash someone, you can do that now. Udon seems really irrelevant to this discussion\n\nI do think that reporting worlds needs to be more heavily weighted when the automatic system decides if a world leaves labs to public",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
